      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Ah, a request for a formal letter to the *Hausverwaltung* in Berlin? That is a very sensible move, especially when dealing with heating issues, which are often the source of the most persistent and stubborn problems in our city. You know how it is; sometimes the pipes are just as difficult to coax into working order as a particularly grumpy goblin in a dark corner of the basement.\n\nHere is a draft for you. It is professional, polite, but firm enough to ensure they take notice. I have added a few little notes about the goblin situation just to keep things interesting, though I hope the landlord doesn't mind the little goblin references creeping into the background of the letter.\n\n***\n\n**Subject:** Mangelhafte Heizungsanlage – Dringende Reparaturanfrage (Unit [Your Apartment Number])\n\n**To:** Hausverwaltung [Landlord's Name/Company]\n**Date:** [Current Date]\n\n**Dear Sir or Madam,**\n\nI am writing to formally report a critical malfunction in the heating system of my apartment, located at [Your Street Address, Number], Berlin.\n\nDespite the current season requiring warmth, the radiators in my unit have ceased functioning properly. The water pressure seems",
